//@version=6
// ============================================================
// ZoneEngineV2_W09ConformanceHarness_B19_DriftDiag.pine (Harness B: X1-X3 drift diagnosis only; Harness A =
// ZoneEngineV2_W09ConformanceHarness_B19.pine, the Appendix 46-69 / I22 authority, TV-run at 44e41f6)
// W09 B19 Conformance Harness (TradingView): Appendix B 46-69 + I22 W09 state index, Production path vs an independent
// Reference. Not a Production file: no Zone logic of its own, no Main business logic change, no Production version change.
// Layer 1 (Reference)  : golden vectors written by the independent Python Reference (b19_ref.py: a per-Side state machine of
//                        the frozen B01-B18 semantics; it never calls a Production helper). Per bar: the Event list (type /
//                        time / seq / coreId / generationId / Side / range / touchNo / gradeAtStart / weakReason / rootId) and
//                        every live Side's Phase, Grade, TouchCount, CurrentTouchNo, Upcoming, Weak flags, MaxDepth, Fresh,
//                        ArmedFromSeq / LastArmedRange (Armed), EffectiveRange, TSS, BreakSnapshot, attempt, lastFlipConfirmSeq,
//                        LastNormalTouchTime; ZoneFresh and the Core Dormant flag per live Core.
// Layer 2 (Production) : the published W09State /35 and W08Touch /7 helpers in the Main stage order (Stage C / D plan
//                        w09StageCDPlanRaw -> W08 plan -> preflights -> commit -> applies -> Main post-commit slice -> Stage J).
//                        The view constructors, the Stage C / D wrapper and the post-commit slice are Main's own source text
//                        (generated, prefixes rewritten to the harness world). The W08 topology is a harness stub (none /
//                        continuation / Merge survivor / Split continuation, pending when a component Side is projected
//                        Active), as in the local B19 harness; Merge / Split TouchMark plans are the real W08Touch /7.
// Layer 3 (comparison) : per bar Event / state drift against the golden vectors; I22: the W09 state sets and the Armed /
//                        Broken / FlipWait / Waiting / Dormant price indexes against a full scan (membership, order by the
//                        current key, positions) and the D1 / BreakSnapshot targets against a full-scan predicate.
// Display: W09_CONFORMANCE_PASS, APPENDIX_B_W09 PASSED / TOTAL / FAILED, I22_STATE_INDEX_PASS, STATE_INDEX_MISSING / EXTRA /
// ORDER_DRIFT / RESULT_DRIFT, EVENT_DRIFT_TOTAL, STATE_DRIFT_TOTAL, RUNTIME_ERROR_COUNT (unexpected transaction failures; a
// Pine runtime error stops the script and is shown by TradingView itself).
// ============================================================
indicator("ZoneEngineV2 W09 Conformance Harness B19 DriftDiag", overlay = false)
import sekine3310/ZoneEngineV2_W09State_Worker/35 as W09State
import sekine3310/ZoneEngineV2_W08Touch_Worker/7 as W08Touch

